# CLINE RULES - Imperia v4 Project
# Last updated: 2026-10-28

## INVARIANT 1: File Separation
Never merge or conflate docs/index.html and docs/kassator.html.
These are distinct UI modules:
- docs/index.html → Master Sovereign UI (leaflet map, regional filters, territory passports)
- docs/kassator.html → Kassator Telemetry UI (separate functionality, do not combine)

Violating this invariant breaks the 3-tier filter architecture and master override controls.

## INVARIANT 2: Session State Persistence
All inter-session state changes MUST be persisted to:
- docs/state_gateway.json → Tenant session state, Q-bounds, region selections
- docs/master_checklist.md → Master override status, completion flags, audit logs

Never rely on in-memory state across sessions. The sl8_gateway.js depends on these persisted files for cross-session continuity.

## INVARIANT 3: Specification v3.0 Compliance
All UI implementations must strictly adhere to tz-slate-integration-v3.md specification.
Critical requirements:
- Tailwind CSS CDN with intentional class names
- Leaflet 1.9.4 from Cloudflare CDN
- Ukrainian language (lang="uk") throughout
- 3-tier filter dropdowns (country → region → module)
- Full-width Leaflet map as dominant visual center
- Regional passport rows with 4D ecology vectors E = [E_lang, E_geo, E_hist, E_soc]^T
- Master override control buttons with proper alert messages
- H3 geo-matrix module options
- Kassator UI linking

Any UI file in docs/ must pass specification v3.0 review before commit.